WEBVTT

00:36:28.260 --> 00:36:31.436
This is something Scott has been doing
during the current crisis:

00:36:31.460 --> 00:36:34.216
thinking about memories
from his days in space.

00:36:34.240 --> 00:36:37.866
SK: When people ask me,
"Well, what do you miss about space?"

00:36:37.890 --> 00:36:41.676
It's not launching in the rocket.

00:36:42.090 --> 00:36:43.876
It's not doing a space walk.

00:36:43.900 --> 00:36:47.246
It's not floating around.
It's not the view.

00:36:47.270 --> 00:36:50.106
It is the people I was there with

00:36:50.130 --> 00:36:52.866
and also the sense of purpose.

00:36:52.890 --> 00:36:55.396
AG: What I heard there was nostalgia.

00:36:55.420 --> 00:37:00.006
The Greek roots of nostalgia
translate to "return" and "pain."